From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 01:56:55 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Windows 10 Mobile: the page's tools and installed apps in the
 phone's menu, apps pinned to Start, an app's window in the browser's colours,
 dialogs no wider than a phone

---
